+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later */
+/*
+ * Pinctrl / GPIO driver for StarFive JHB100 SoC
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2024 StarFive Technology Co., Ltd.
+ * Author: Alex Soo <yuklin.soo@starfivetech.com>
